{"text":"#include <iostream>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\ntemplate <typename t1, typename t2>\nvoid swap(t1 a, t2 b);\n\n\nint main(){\n\n\n    swap(3 , 6);\n\n\n    //std::cout << swap(3 , 5)<<std::endl;\n\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename t1, typename t2>\nvoid swap (t1 a , t2 b){\n\n    cout<<\" the first number is  \"<< a <<\" and the second number is  \"<<b<<endl;\n\n\n    t1 temp = a;\n\n    a = b;\n\n    b = temp;\n\n     cout<<\" now the first number is  \"<< a <<\" and the second number is  \"<<b<<endl;\n\n\n}\n","version":1,"path":"exercises/module5/templateSwap.cpp","snapshot":true,"doc":3,"seq":20,"ms":1626119,"op":"snap"}
